n employee's  vaccination status now where a trucker  doesn't often drive across border they  mostly drive within  the border then an employer is expected  to work with them to make it happen so  that they don't have to cross the border  anymore or where it's a real and  fundamental term of employment that you  cross the border you're the guy that  crosses the border the employer in this  case is not required to change that to  make it different to give them a  different route they can simply say  unfortunately you can't do the job and  until that happens or until that changes  you you don't work here so that  accommodation requirement is going to be  quite limited here
 

